{
  "sourcePatchId": "stereo-auto-wah-wah-v1",
  "name": "Stereo Auto Wah Wah",
  "description": "Stereo RMS-driven auto wah using two moogvcf filters. Stereo Link combines channel energy without phase cancellation; Off follows each channel independently. Quantization 0 is continuous; positive values set musical cutoff steps relative to Base cutoff. Transition half-time softens the jumps independently of RMS integration. Fully wet output; use mixer level and insert bypass. No MIDI notes or CCs required. Restart the rack after changing performance controllers.",
